    standfirst: 'DAA Capital Partners has successfully expanded its Logistics Opportunities Fund by acquiring a 6,695 square meter last-mile warehouse, leased to Legendre, in Montigny-le-Bretonneux, Île-de-France. The asset is strategically located in a highly sought-after region for logistics operations, owing to its exceptional transport links. The area is directly linked to the A12 highway, providing convenient access',
